2.
Definitions.
- In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires-
(i)
"Act" means the Uttar Pradesh Resin and Other Forest Produce (Regulation of Trade) Act, 1976;
(ii)
"Divisional Forest Officer" means the Forest Officer incharge of a Forest Division;
(iii)
"Forest Export Chauki" means a chauki established under Section 41 of the Indian Forest Act, 1927;
(iv)
"Form" means a form appended to these rules;
(v)
"Manufacturer of resin products" includes a person owning factory for manufactures of resin products;
(vi)
"Section" means a section of the Act;
(vii)
All other words and expression used in the Act but not defined in these rules shall have the meaning assigned to them in
Act.
